# The reads go off the entry parameter; where no options are given THE CALLER writes `{}`. What is seen to arrive is that literal without names (L0) beside the layout that answers (L2): no family holds
# the two, so nothing was tested and all eight reads went by name (280 instructions a turn with options given; 166 now). The layouts that answer are asked; the literal is left to the closed arm, which is
# as likely (a read of a name that a literal of the caller lacks has no typed form: a second turn bought nothing there). f1 = configure.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = ShapeTest {{*}}layouts=[L2] [refusesMarkedObjects]
# CHECK: = GetSlot {{*}}key="encoding" receivers=[L2] level=Proven
# CHECK-NOT: layouts=[L0]
# CHECK: = GetSlot {{*}}key="limit" receivers=[L2] level=Proven
